  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La Oficina OMIL de la Municipalidad de Maullín está apoyando un proceso de entrevistas para la contratación de trabajadores para la planta de procesos de Primar, en Puerto Montt.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"👥\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t8b/1/16/1f465.png\"/> La iniciativa busca entregar nuevas oportunidades laborales a vecinos y vecinas de la comuna.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🚌\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t79/1/16/1f68c.png\"/> El trabajo contempla movilización y colación, facilitando el traslado diario entre Maullín y Puerto Montt.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📲\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/td8/1/16/1f4f2.png\"/> Las oportunidades laborales son difundidas a través de las redes sociales de la Municipalidad de Maullín y OMIL.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🤝\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t64/1/16/1f91d.png\"/> OMIL Maullín continúa fortaleciendo la vinculación entre empresas y trabajadores, generando oportunidades de empleo para la comunidad.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente comunicaciones munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12967\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/23e1rq0j0wk8jsb/omil_05_kz0dlsea9d.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-14 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12962\" data-id=\"12962\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/ehs45c9tet80lcf/omil_01_1024x683_fdu23pqjki.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12965\" data-id=\"12965\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/4jzsgs40368o5tn/omil_02_1024x683_0qu0apk0ld.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12964\" data-id=\"12964\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/ndhde2ebafmmemr/omil_04_1024x683_inyk52i1he.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12968\" data-id=\"12968\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/hwkwsb1i505ihmo/omil_06_1024x683_cww9pji4me.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n</figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12963\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" on